   "key": "func ArchiveStore.archiveBatch(_:)",
   "hash": "0b580be2c36d5fc6",
   "does": "Takes the lock and archives a batch: each session goes through archiveOne (skip tombstoned/known/unmergeable in-batch copies, merge into an existing copy or same-sleep entry — one written earlier in the batch included —, or write a new pretty-printed file that joins the in-memory index at once); the index is saved once at the end; posts per-id change notifications for merged sessions and one nil change notification. Returns new + updated count. On a mid-batch throw (a write or a merge that failed), saves the index with the files already written and rethrows.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+Batch.swift::func ArchiveStore.archiveOne(_:into:)",
